5/300 
 
Thanks to Dave Osbourne for sorting my problem :-
 
Before actually replacing the processors you need to issue a cpu_upgrade
command at the firmware upgrade prompt (UPD>>). When this process is
complete you can then replace the processor boards - everything should then
be fine on powerup (need to boot genvmunix etc and recompile kernel)
 
