Just noticed another problem. I have recently upgraded this machine to T64
V5.1. I have just discovered some errors in the logs that I have not seen
before... does anybody know what they mean ? Machine seems to be running
fairly normally otherwise.
 
Oct 22 14:18:49 whse vmunix: Machine Check error corrected by processor
