Doesn't DLT work with 1000A?=20
It works OK with our ES40, XP1000 and even with old AlphaStations 255.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The consensus is that QLogic SCSI controller inside AS100A doesn't
support both internal and external buses at the same time.
External SCSI connector might even be disconnected from SCSI controller.

NCR 810 SCSI controller inside AW255 is designed to support external and
internal SCSI buses simultaniously.

As someone from Compaq rightly said, my assumption that anything, I can
see on Compaq box, should work is an "arrogant, ignorant and incredibly
naive one".
Well...here we are then.=20

"I've learned my lesson". - Homer Simpson

Best regards=20

Nik Tarasyuk
Snowy Hydro
Australia

