Thanks to Anthony A. D. Talltree, Peter Stern, sysadmin@astro
and Magali Bernard for their kind attention. The problem was in
fact in ghostscript and was solved by adding the following link

/usr/local/lib/ghostscript  ->  
      /directory_where_ghostview_is_in_the_other_machine/ghostview

so that /fonts were accessible. Other directories were already at
hand.

Thanks again,

	Oyanarte Portilho



