> |
> |                         system   6 Jul 22 22:01 /usr/var ->../var
> |
> |
> |
> |    3.  Verify that the system startup files in /etc/rc.config are
> |
> |        valid.  For example, rc.config may contain a bogus entry
> |
> |        which will result in the system coming up as Amnesiac.
> |
