From tru64-unix-managers  Mon Oct 15 10:27:45 2001
From: "Copper, Steve" <scopper () westernpower ! co ! uk>
Date: Mon, 15 Oct 2001 10:27:45 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: UPDATE SUMMARY: NPROC Process
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653641821808

As pointed out by Gavin Kreuiter

nproc is the max TOTAL processes on a system.
max-proc-per-user is the maximum for an INDIVIDUAL user.

Tru64 does not have a nproc equivalent; it is implicit in the
value of maxusers.


Steve Copper


