Hello everyone:

Many thanks to John Becker, Tom Webster, and Dr. Blinn. I renamed the
/FMG_LOCAL_PARAM_LIBRARY.KNL and then run dia again, everything is working
great. dia recreates the FMG_LOCAL_PARAM_LIBRARY.KNL file.

Here is the procedure provides by John:

In the default directory from which you ran dia, the file
FMG_LOCAL_PARAM_LIBRARY.KNL has a problem.  Please rename
it to .SAVE and retry the dia command.  If it works, delete
the .SAVE.  If it fails, reinstall decevent.  It 
will not harm your environment to reinstall it.

Thanks.

Warren

