Hello,

(Sorry Dave:-)

thanks again for the fast and good responses.

Thanks to Rainer Wolf who made following reply:
--- snip ---
you can try
'lmf reset 0'

... if it does not work you may use a wrong license/you don't
have enough points ... it maybe a license for a Workstation or so  ...
if you can modify the points you may increse them ( i think if mod_units is
set
)
--- snip ---

The following worked for me:
# lmf reset
---> showed me the license whioch had not enough units
lmf modify <lincense name>

--> set "Number of Units =0" (unlimited)

exit
The next lmf register will have the lincense up.
This is of course only a workaround and you will have to
consult your sales people if you are alowed to keep that.
Thanks also to
Chris Cook, Perter Stern, Glen Grice,Nick Leonard, thomas Blinn, Kevin Mc
Dowell .......

Have fun
Samier.

