Thanks go to Andrew Tolmie (who I know has just been through the same 
update process). The entry I required was along the lines of:

mc0|loader:\
        :mc=/dev/changer/mc0:\
        :dn=/dev/ntape/tape0_d1:tc=tl810:

My braindead mistake was in trying to use the old /dev/mc33 device file which 
still exists after the upgrade.

Joe



